You'd wondered when your shonky potion-making would catch up to you
Townsfolk: Potionmaker.
Townsfolk: We've come to discuss your business practices
Townsfolk: But first, where is your master?
Townsfolk: Sigmund Frogg?
- I've no idea
	Townsfolk: Well then
