	You: Yes. I changed him
	Master Frogg: Ribbit! (You improvident lackwit!)
	Master Frogg: Ribbit ribbit! (You'd sell me out after all I did for you?)
	Townsfolk: Well, good riddance I say
	Townsfolk: Still, we aren't satisfied
	Townsfolk: Frogg, you've got a choice
	Townsfolk: Either you do this the easy way, and come with us, or do it the hard way, and get punished right here and right now.
